<table class="meta"><tr><td><b>Cashier</b><br><?php echo e($report['cashier']); ?><br><?php echo e($report['cashier_email']); ?></td><td><b>Session opened</b><br><?php echo e($report['opened_at']); ?><br><b>Closed by:</b> <?php echo e($report['closed_by']); ?></td><td><b>Closed at</b><br><?php echo e($report['closed_at']); ?><br><?php echo e($report['timezone']); ?></td></tr></table>
<p class="muted">Daily activity includes this cashier's transactions at this branch from 00:00 on <?php echo e($report['date']); ?> through <?php echo e($report['cutoff']); ?>. It includes earlier sessions on the same date. This is a saved closing snapshot; later activity is excluded.</p>
<h2>01 / Daily activity overview</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Invoices issued</th><th class="right">Invoice value</th><th class="right">Payment entries</th><th class="right">Net money collected</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="total"><td><?php echo e(count($report['invoices'])); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['invoice_total'])); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e(count($report['payments'])); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['net_collected'])); ?></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="muted small">Invoice value and money collected are separate totals. Collections can include advances and payments for older invoices. Credit allocations are not money received.</p>
<h2>02 / Payment method summary — daily activity</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Payment method</th><th class="right">Entries</th><th class="right">Received / allocated</th><th class="right">Refund / credit reduction</th><th class="right">Net</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $__currentLoopData = $report['methods']; $__env->addLoop($__currentLoopData); foreach($__currentLoopData as $m): $__env->incrementLoopIndices(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?><tr><td><?php echo e($m['label']); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($m['count']); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($m['receipts'])); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($m['refunds'])); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($m['net'])); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; $__env->popLoop(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?></tbody></table>
<h2>03 / Cash drawer reconciliation — this session only</h2><table><tbody>
<tr><td>Opening cash</td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['opening_cash'])); ?></td></tr>
<tr><td>Net cash movement in this session</td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['expected_cash']-$report['opening_cash'])); ?></td></tr>
<tr><td>Expected drawer cash</td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['expected_cash'])); ?></td></tr>
<tr><td>Counted drawer cash</td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money($report['counted_cash'])); ?></td></tr>
<tr class="total"><td><?php echo e($report['variance'] < 0 ? 'Shortage' : ($report['variance'] > 0 ? 'Overage' : 'Balanced')); ?></td><td class="right"><?php echo e($money(abs($report['variance']))); ?></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="muted small">Card, bank, Koko, other payments and credit are excluded from the cash drawer. If this shift crosses midnight, session cash covers the full shift while daily activity covers the closing date.</p>
